#: app/admin/templates/backups.html:101
msgid "<b>Do not use your account password:</b> the gateway does not know it (it only stores a hash), it changes over time, and for a RADIUS user it is not even theirs. Choose a dedicated one and keep it in a safe place (password manager). The gateway <b>does not store it</b>: it writes the backups without asking for it, but <b>without it nobody can open them</b>, not even another administrator."
